    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_oo2ZJK4LBgvUX5Uo",
      "label": "Paragraph",
      "default": "<p><strong>What does flavoured air taste like?</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_tKaqTrkBnbCT2oUX",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Lio’s flavoured air provides a subtle, natural taste designed to help you quit smoking or vaping. </p><p></p><p>It’s less intense than vapor but refreshing, similar to a lightly infused herbal tea or soda without the sweetness.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_tGBngsvr3OMY4kVd",
      "label": "Paragraph",
      "default": "<p><strong>How does Lio work?</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_m3zWhkKYlCStvtG3",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Lio offers nicotine-free, naturally flavored air to help you quit bad habits effortlessly. 100% natural and 90% cheaper than smoking, it keeps the hand-to-mouth habit for an easy transition. </p><p></p><p>Trusted by 50,000+ customers and backed by a 30-day money-back guarantee, it’s the easiest choice for a healthier life.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_20VMCBHURbDWrpYE",
      "label": "Paragraph",
      "default": "<p><strong>How To Use Lio? </strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_Tse8AU7Ry5Fxh1lo",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p><strong>Using Your Lio Is Simple—Just 3 Steps</strong></p><ol><li><p><strong>Fray</strong> your preferred flavour core.</p></li><li><p><strong>Slide</strong> the core into the Lio.</p></li><li><p><strong>Relief</strong> your cravings.</p></li></ol>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_0JxTCIw0txvUvkDn",
      "label": "Paragraph",
      "default": "<p><strong>Shipping &amp; Refunds</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_YzzYMTPlGHBjMAWl",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>We ship worldwide for free from the Netherlands!</p><p></p><p>Delivery takes <strong>2-3 days within Europe</strong>, <strong>3-4 days to the UK</strong>, <strong>4-8 days outside Europe</strong>, and <strong>next-day delivery in the Middle East</strong> (from Dubai). </p><p></p><p>Enjoy fast, reliable shipping at no extra cost.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_R8O1fcabdURXeBv7",
      "label": "Paragraph",
      "default": "<p><strong>Money Back Guarantee</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_HUgiBucn6ggZ015n",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>If you’ve used Lio™, commit to a 30 days to experience its benefits. After completing the 30-day journey, you have 7 days to request a refund if you’re not satisfied. This ensures you have enough time to fully explore its impact before making a decision.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_jwz3pRbAcT1acbpe",
      "label": "Paragraph",
      "default": "<p><strong>Is Lio safe?</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_NBDVSHvL87LPAJzy",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p><strong>Absolutely!</strong> Lio is made from 100% natural ingredients, including essential oils, plant extracts, and natural flavors. It’s completely free of nicotine, chemicals, or harmful toxins, making it a safe, clean alternative to smoking and vaping.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_cTMIQscOVGiapS7f",
      "label": "Paragraph",
      "default": "<p><strong>How often can I use Lio?</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_DH97rlckxNvYlFtk",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>You can use Lio as often as you like. It’s completely natural and free of nicotine, smoke, or vapor, so there’s no harm in frequent use.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_yfBo82QktYOoSNAI",
      "label": "Paragraph",
      "default": "<p><strong>How long do Flavour Cores last?</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_IZtxD2zwn7UBktzE",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Each Flavour Core is designed to last up to <strong>2 to 3 days</strong> with regular use, depending on how often you use your Lio. A pack of six cores provides enough flavour for <strong>60 days</strong>.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "image_Ycf2trwtQcPwG6rX",
      "label": "Image"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_OxwzB5Kai5tC89Q8",
      "label": "Rating",
      "default": "<p><strong>FREE WORLDWIDE SHIPPING</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "image_yGwSf22CuNB5j9bm",
      "label": "Image"
